  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Data Science Skills School for Research in Sustainable Agriculture across the southern African Development Community</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research training grant to build capacity in the Southern Africa development community for data curation from long-term agricultural experiments to support sustainable intensification. Facilitating the exchange of data within and between countries will accelerate changes in practice towards sustainability, e.g. by increasing carbon sequestration and reducing soil erosion.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
